  "details": "Well, if you're in big trouble, you need escape button. Like in MMO games if you're stuck, you can hit escape.\n\nWhen you fell down of launched by some strange effect, you cannot use VRChat menu option, because it will fly away or you cannot touch the menu buttons. They're just not working at all.\n\nOr you're stuck in some animation or very laggy world, or your vision is corrupted in some worlds (yes it's possible).\nThere are many examples you want escape.\n\nThere should special key or controller button, like keep press both grab button together and it will activate escape function. You will send back to standard VRChat home room (not your home room, some users can even stuck in own selected home room).\n\nYou don't need restart VRChat over again for it. Usually that is only option if you're in the loop of world falling down or launched or getting visual errors. Also when player attack you, or you're very laggy, escape must possible.\n\nEspecially we can try out worlds in Testing part worlds, problems are possible.",
